---
title: "System Context Diagram"
---


flowchart TB

    USER["Users"]

    WEB["SvelteKit Web App"]
    MOBILE["Jetpack Compose Mobile App"]

    CDN["CDN / Edge Cache"]

    GATEWAY["API Gateway"]

    AUTH["Auth Service"]
    USER_SVC["User Service"]
    CHAT["Chat Service"]
    REALTIME["Realtime Service"]
    MEDIA["Media Service"]
    NOTIF["Notification Service"]
    SEARCH["Search Service"]
    PRESENCE["Presence Service"]

    NATS["NATS Event Bus"]

    REDIS["Redis Cluster"]

    POSTGRES["PostgreSQL Cluster"]

    MINIO["MinIO / S3"]

    OBS["Observability Stack"]

    USER --> WEB
    USER --> MOBILE

    WEB --> CDN
    MOBILE --> GATEWAY

    CDN --> GATEWAY

    GATEWAY --> AUTH
    GATEWAY --> USER_SVC
    GATEWAY --> CHAT
    GATEWAY --> REALTIME
    GATEWAY --> MEDIA

    CHAT --> NATS
    AUTH --> NATS
    USER_SVC --> NATS
    MEDIA --> NATS

    NATS --> REALTIME
    NATS --> NOTIF
    NATS --> SEARCH
    NATS --> PRESENCE

    AUTH --> POSTGRES
    USER_SVC --> POSTGRES
    CHAT --> POSTGRES
    MEDIA --> POSTGRES

    REALTIME --> REDIS
    PRESENCE --> REDIS
    GATEWAY --> REDIS

    MEDIA --> MINIO

    GATEWAY --> OBS
    AUTH --> OBS
    USER_SVC --> OBS
    CHAT --> OBS
    REALTIME --> OBS
    MEDIA --> OBS
    NOTIF --> OBS
    SEARCH --> OBS